stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Listening
    Listening --> SpeechDetected : VAD thấy giọng
    SpeechDetected --> Recognizing : chốt câu
    Recognizing --> Listening : câu bịa / rỗng: bỏ
    Recognizing --> Translating : có văn bản
    Translating --> Completed : chiều về, không TTS
    Translating --> WaitingForConfirmation : chiều đi, bật duyệt
    Translating --> Synthesizing : chiều đi, không duyệt
    WaitingForConfirmation --> Synthesizing : confirm
    WaitingForConfirmation --> Completed : discard
    Synthesizing --> Speaking
    Speaking --> Completed
    Recognizing --> Error
    Translating --> Error
    Synthesizing --> Error
    Completed --> [*]
    Error --> [*]
